hushphone (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep the data directory its owner's alone; the process cannot be dumped or traced.
  * On Android, keep the state out of backups and device transfers.
  * Read caps, write caps and voucher secrets in guarded memory, wiped on drop.
  * Use pigeonhole_protocols, now one crate.

 -- Katzenpost <packages@katzenpost.network>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:09:22 +0000

hushphone (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Join through katzenqt voucher replies without rosters, and retry voucher reads that fail.
  * Reopen the client when it stops; cancel a pending join.
  * A seccomp filter in the binary and an AppArmor profile: no IP sockets, no programs.
  * On Android, reach kpclientd through kpclientd-android's connect, with no network.

 -- Katzenpost <packages@katzenpost.network>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:42:26 +0000

